{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the Moving Simulator: Demo Edition!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get a first taste of the chaos and charm of running your own moving business. In this demo, you\u2019ll step into the shoes of a mover tackling real-world challenges\u2014packing, lifting, loading, and securing cargo\u2014all while dealing with tight spaces and unexpected surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771760/extras/MS_03.gif?t=1753369734\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it\u2019s maneuvering a couch through a narrow hallway or stacking boxes like a Tetris pro, every move counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771760/extras/MS_02.gif?t=1753369734\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hands-On Moving Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Experience the core gameplay loop: pack items, move furniture, and load the truck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One Unique Relocation Mission</strong> \u2013 The demo features one full moving job, with a detailed apartment, packed with furniture, belongings, and logistical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Problem-Solving Fun</strong> \u2013 Navigate tight doorways and awkward angles using your wits and a bit of muscle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Taste of the Chaos</strong> \u2013 Encounter a few of the humorous mishaps and physics-driven moments the full game is known for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771760/extras/MS_04.gif?t=1753369734\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to handle the pressure? The full job awaits in <i>Moving Simulator</i>\u2014wishlist now and stay tuned for launch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771760?t=1753369734","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771760?t=1753369734","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771760/16a39e69eedb537946b720a7134ab6d55b744d8b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753369734","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771760/16a39e69eedb537946b720a7134ab6d55b744d8b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753369734","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the Moving Simulator: Demo Edition!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get a first taste of the chaos and charm of running your own moving business. In this demo, you\u2019ll step into the shoes of a mover tackling real-world challenges\u2014packing, lifting, loading, and securing cargo\u2014all while dealing with tight spaces and unexpected surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771760/extras/MS_03.gif?t=1753369734\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it\u2019s maneuvering a couch through a narrow hallway or stacking boxes like a Tetris pro, every move counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_i